      "content": "<section class=\"testimonials-template\" aria-labelledby=\"testimonials-title\">\n  <header><h2 id=\"testimonials-title\">用户怎么说</h2><p>来自长期使用者的真实反馈。</p></header>\n  <div class=\"testimonials-template__grid\">\n    <figure><blockquote>“团队协作效率明显提升，过去一周才能完成的交付，现在几天就能稳定上线。”</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/96?img=1\" alt=\"张伟的头像\"><span><strong>张伟</strong><small>科技公司负责人</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><blockquote>“界面清晰，团队新人一天就能上手；遇到问题时也能很快找到答案。”</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/96?img=5\" alt=\"李娜的头像\"><span><strong>李娜</strong><small>互联网产品经理</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><blockquote>“接入现有工作流很顺利，文档中的示例具体，减少了大量重复沟通。”</blockquote><figcaption><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/96?img=8\" alt=\"王强的头像\"><span><strong>王强</strong><small>金融科技技术负责人</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"#stories\">阅读更多用户故事</a>\n</section>\n<style>\n.testimonials-template { box-sizing: border-box; padding: 72px 24px; color: #0f172a; background: #f8fafc; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.testimonials-template > header { margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center; }\n.testimonials-template h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }\n.testimonials-template > header p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #64748b; }\n.testimonials-template__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 22px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.testimonials-template figure { margin: 0; padding: 30px; border-radius: 18px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, .07); }\n.testimonials-template blockquote { margin: 0 0 24px; color: #334155; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; }\n.testimonials-template figcaption { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n.testimonials-template img { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }\n.testimonials-template figcaption span { display: grid; gap: 3px; }\n.testimonials-template small { color: #64748b; }\n.testimonials-template > a { display: block; width: fit-content; min-height: 44px; margin: 32px auto 0; padding: 12px; color: #4338ca; font-weight: 700; }\n.testimonials-template a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #818cf8; outline-offset: 3px; }\n</style>\n"
